('whisky-distilleries', 'wd-Q59728286', 'silent', 'Nun''s Island Distillery', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nun%27s_Island_Distillery', 'Nun''s Island Distillery', 'CC BY-SA 4.0', 'Wikipedia''s Nun''s Island Distillery article places the Irish whiskey still on Nun''s Island, Galway, and says production ceased about 1908.', 'Nun''s_Island_Distillery', 'high', 'accepted');
