('tidal-islands', 'osm-way-44964450', 'tidal', 'Tidal island on Gunna', 'https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q124466765', 'Eilean nam Maidean', 'CC0', 'Wikidata Q124466765 is the item on this atlas island. It is an instance of tidal island (Q555937) and its English description is this phrase. The item''s English label is Eilean nam Maidean; the atlas name is Soy Gunna.', 'Q124466765', 'high', 'accepted'),
